## Methods credited but not copied

The following works are implemented following their papers; no source code from them
is included here.

- PatchGAN discriminator — Isola et al., "Image-to-Image Translation with Conditional
  Adversarial Networks", CVPR 2017 (`bandtok/losses/discriminators.py`).
- MelGAN / HiFi-GAN / DAC — multi-scale discriminator and feature-matching training
  scheme (`bandtok/losses/discriminators.py`).
- MelTok (formerly MelCap) — Li et al., "MelTok: 2D Tokenization for Single-Codebook Audio
  Compression", arXiv:2510.01903, 2025 (https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.01903). The
  Mel-spectrogram single-codebook 2D tokenizer architecture that BandTok's tokenizer
  follows (`bandtok/models/tokenizer.py`, `bandtok/modules/quantize.py`,
  `bandtok/modules/patching.py`).
- Qwen3-VL — Interleaved-MRoPE, the basis of BandTok's 2D RoPE.
- T5 — Raffel et al., text encoder used for caption conditioning
  (weights fetched from the Hugging Face Hub at runtime).

## Datasets

The datasets used in the paper (FMA, Freesound, MTG-Jamendo, MUSDB18-HQ,
SongDescriber) are distributed by their respective authors under their own terms and are
not included in this repository. See `docs/DATA.md`.
